es to fighting crime and  chasing down scoundrels it's certainly  much harder to come up with resolution  if you don't know what the real problem  is  when hitch and i were after the camera  real kid we didn't know what he was  after or where he was headed but  once we figured out he was after the  trinity we had a much better chance of  catching him as we were trying to  recover the trinity we ran into  conflicts and obstacles every step of  the way from an army of knights and  armor to a double cross in mayor  wow what a story it's like every moment  builds on top of the one before  until everything finally gets fixed  wait  dil that's perfect you have no idea how  much you just helped you totally saved  my day very glad to hear it  i'll be on my way hitch is waiting at  the station for me  best of luck miss donna  what dare goes through in trinity  all of the ups and downs the action  moments and the resolution she finally  comes to with hitch  those are all elements you need to  create a plot of any story  i've so got it this hint is all about  plot it's the whole reason why i've put  together my character and setting to  actually put them into the story i bet  there's a good chapter in trinity full  of action-packed plot moments to help me  out  let's try chapter eight  at this point in the story we already  know that the ribbons are a rebel colony  living on a planet called tensor4 and  they're causing a lot more trouble than  anyone realized i can't wait to read how  dale uses her training as a sky marshal  to help her out  come out come out the bald riven call to  dale in a sing-song voice  you don't want us to blow up in the  hatch now do you  whoa  dale's mind raced she was scared  really scared  what do you want from me she called out  from you nothing at all the riven called  back you're free to go  we want your ship  no they couldn't get the ship  it would be better if it was destroyed  and dale knew how  okay dale called i'm coming out  she had to work